es, as well as enhances crop health above and below ground through nitrogen management and seed-applied technologies. This segment provides herbicides, insecticides, nitrogen stabilizers, and pasture and range management herbicides. It serves agricultural input industry. The company operates in the United States, Canada, Latin America, the Asia Pacific, Europe, the Middle East, and Africa. The company was founded in 1802 and is headquartered in Indianapolis, Indiana.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"0100","sic_desc":"Agricultural Production-Crops","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Agricultural Inputs","mcap":51867820032,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","exchange":"XNYS","cik":1755672,"massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-10-03","q":[{"end":"2023-09-30","rev":2590000000.0,"rev_yoy":-6.7,"eps":-0.45,"eps_yoy":2.2,"ni":-321000000.0,"ni_yoy":3.0,"nm":-12.4,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2023-12-31","rev":3707000000.0,"rev_yoy":-3.1,"eps":-0.36,"eps_yoy":-350.0,"ni":-253000000.0,"ni_yoy":-360.0,"nm":-6.8,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2024-03-31","rev":4492000000.0,"rev_yoy":-8.0,"eps":0.6,"eps_yoy":-27.7,"ni":419000000.0,"ni_yoy":-29.6,"nm":9.3,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-06-30","rev":6112000000.0,"rev_yoy":1.1,"eps":1.51,"eps_yoy":51.0,"ni":1053000000.0,"ni_yoy":47.5,"nm":17.2,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-09-30","rev":2326000000.0,"rev_yoy":-10.2,"eps":-0.76,"eps_yoy":-68.9,"ni":-524000000.0,"ni_yoy":-63.2,"nm":-22.5,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-12-31","rev":3978000000.0,"rev_yoy":7.3,"eps":-0.05,"eps_yoy":86.1,"ni":-41000000.0,"ni_yoy":83.8,"nm":-1.0,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2025-03-31","rev":4417000000.0,"rev_yoy":-1.7,"eps":0.95,"eps_yoy":58.3,"ni":652000000.0,"ni_yoy":55.6,"nm":14.8,"derive